{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_7D67DDCD","title":"Find the Student","entry":"Dlg_7D67DDCD::entry","exit":"Dlg_7D67DDCD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_BFB56CE8","articyId":"72057697117171792","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"You make quite the frame standing with that in the background.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You make quite the frame standing with that in the background.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-100.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43598","byteOffset":30822520,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_9651A9DD","articyId":"72057697117171807","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Oh, hey. Fancy seeing you around here. Hoping I'll snap a shot just as you're doing something epic?","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, hey. Fancy seeing you around here. Hoping I'll snap a shot just as you're doing something epic?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":-100.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45500","byteOffset":31546440,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_0C83425A","articyId":"72057697117171838","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Sorry. My head's always in the lens, you know? When you've been taking pictures as long as I have it becomes impossible to separate.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sorry. My head's always in the lens, you know? When you've been taking pictures as long as I have it becomes impossible to separate.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":550.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22908","byteOffset":16550712,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_53F9A81A","articyId":"72057697117171855","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Student, actually. One day this will be my official job but I gotta work myself out of the hole first.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Student, actually. One day this will be my official job but I gotta work myself out of the hole first.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1150.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43400","byteOffset":30748688,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_13811034","articyId":"72057697117171883","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Preach. But, hey, least I'm getting some good shots of it all burning down... Sad how true that is.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Preach. But, hey, least I'm getting some good shots of it all burning down... Sad how true that is.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44492","byteOffset":31162096,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_F348D8E9","articyId":"72057697117171890","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Central Canyon Tech. Since their art funding was slashed I do their marketing stuff pro bono and they let me use their labs whenever. It's kind of a nice setup actually.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Central Canyon Tech. Since their art funding was slashed I do their marketing stuff pro bono and they let me use their labs whenever. It's kind of a nice setup actually.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24476","byteOffset":17136920,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_BAE3EF8F","articyId":"72057697117171914","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Oh no, not yet. That's more for when your work gets monetized. Pretty much the only purpose of them is so SecTalent can log what you're doing and how much you're making.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh no, not yet. That's more for when your work gets monetized. Pretty much the only purpose of them is so SecTalent can log what you're doing and how much you're making.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2337.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40104","byteOffset":29500720,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_BA5B7487","articyId":"72057697117171935","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Well, it's kinda tricky, you know? Most want them because it's your life's work. But it's also a way to track you. There's artists out there who have work that aren't in compendiums or just purely don't have them.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, it's kinda tricky, you know? Most want them because it's your life's work. But it's also a way to track you. There's artists out there who have work that aren't in compendiums or just purely don't have them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48475","byteOffset":32674144,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_28C6504E","articyId":"72057697117171950","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Depends. In art circles you're an outlaw. Some people love that you buck the norms. Others couldn't care less. Corpsters hate it because of the lost revenue.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Depends. In art circles you're an outlaw. Some people love that you buck the norms. Others couldn't care less. Corpsters hate it because of the lost revenue.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33335","byteOffset":20495336,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_B7180FC6","articyId":"72057697117171977","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Sure. As long as you get a good enough price for it who needs a soul anyway? What has you asking about compendiums?","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure. As long as you get a good enough price for it who needs a soul anyway? What has you asking about compendiums?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4074.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48031","byteOffset":32508224,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_BB839A37","articyId":"72057697117171984","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"If only. Figuratively of course. Though literally would make for some risque photo ops... Anyway, what has you asking about compendiums?","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If only. Figuratively of course. Though literally would make for some risque photo ops... Anyway, what has you asking about compendiums?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4075.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42618","byteOffset":30451352,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_D10F4874","articyId":"72057697117171999","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"The AG? Mr. Anthony himself? Of course. Most have. His legacy is palpable among the community. He was a loss, that's for sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The AG? Mr. Anthony himself? Of course. Most have. His legacy is palpable among the community. He was a loss, that's for sure.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39196","byteOffset":29160472,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_0691E6A5","articyId":"72057697117172013","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"Ohhhhh. I see. The university probably has a copy somewhere. Once an artist is deceased, SecTalent enacts an intellectual easement and assumes ownership.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ohhhhh. I see. The university probably has a copy somewhere. Once an artist is deceased, SecTalent enacts an intellectual easement and assumes ownership.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5262.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49227","byteOffset":32965552,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_3241B47A","articyId":"72057697117172041","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"You're definitely new to this whole area aren't you. If you know someone in Sec they might be able to help you. The University might, but who knows where it is or who has access.","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're definitely new to this whole area aren't you. If you know someone in Sec they might be able to help you. The University might, but who knows where it is or who has access.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5900.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30565","byteOffset":19443296,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_4BFC5F9A","articyId":"72057697117172065","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanya Predex","text":"... clearly. Look, I gotta run. Good luck finding AG's compendium!","speakerId":"Ntt_86034FD6","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... clearly. Look, I gotta run. Good luck finding AG's compendium!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":6500.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39112","byteOffset":29129112,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_306FFFC4","articyId":"72057697117171779","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Work is life.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Work is life.","TextSheVersion":"Work is life.","TextTheyVersion":"Work is life."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":850.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50145","byteOffset":33312752,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_C5E8B3EF","articyId":"72057697117171822","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Ummm?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ummm?","TextSheVersion":"Ummm?","TextTheyVersion":"Ummm?"},"effects":[],"conditions